      "review_description": "Attended office in person, after agreeing on system was informed system would take 4 to 6 weeks to be installed. At around the 5 week mark received a call and the next week the installers installed the system.  I contacted office a few days later and was given the electricians number to install the new meters, 3 days later the system was fully up and running. My total experience with this company, installers and electrician has been very positive indeed. Today has been the first day generating electricity very happy. After sales service is just as important to me as the purchase sales so hopefully this will continune to be positive as i will be adding another 4 panels as funds come available in the next 6 months. Thank you Solar power NSW.",
